Inclusion Criteria:

1. Aged ≥18 years old;
2. Meet the 2019 ACR/EULAR classification criteria or the 2020 Japanese diagnostic criteria for IgG4-RD;
3. Plan to receive treatment with inebilizumab;
4. Signed informed consent form.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Pregnant or lactating female patients;
2. Participation in other interventional studies within 30 days prior to screening, or exposure to investigational products within 5 half-lives before enrollment, or planned participation in other interventional studies during the trial period;
3. Patients with contraindications to inebilizumab treatment;
4. Any other conditions deemed inappropriate for enrollment by the investigator.
